    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Miss Nanou",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113971988513343463122/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_ek9ZzfQ26nt8Gwm3yWbR_yKVAx-khhxaKwP_zF6VNXZ2wQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I have had the best, most flawless experience with Rinku!\nNot only is she extremely talented and skilled, but her service and dedication were outstanding! She worked on both my wedding looks (white dress + wedding lehenga) and they were both stunning!\nI had second thoughts about my original white dress and she walked with me through the whole customization process!\nMy lehenga fit *perfectly* and her special touch made the dress extremely comfortable all through the evening.\n\nHer professionalism matches her awesome personality and I can’t wait to go back to her for my future looks!",
        "time": 1761940819,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lavianna S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117669562329957019070/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnGj5cNtNAT0sK_YgExtG1eXMK65e9B67m8U1AiBD5sEp5v4gy=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I was referred to Rinku by Fashion Avenue Montreal, I brought one lehenga top to get fitted tighter and another top to make bigger, Rinku was able to alter both outfits on time for my events and made my outfits fit much better.\n\nShe is very friendly, kind and flexible in her hours. Her prices are very reasonable also. I had a good experience and will continue to use her services in the future.\n\nThank you Rinku, see you soon!",
        "time": 1762520833,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stéphanie D",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118367976831340252383/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjURvzO0Oy2MQK7cnIQPErFUw-Ij7HmH1f4GQ9dSyugRuiNkolGC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Rinku is a marvel of pristine, impeccable work.\nShe fabricated all manner of scarves, scrunchies and headbands for me out of mulberry silk that I purchased in Montreal's famous textile district. Not only was it obvious by the quality of work that every piece was made with love, many of them even had custom upgrades using her very own unique design ideas that she refused to charge me extra for and needless to say I was delighted.\nWith several other projects in mind, I cannot wait to drop off another carefully chosen piece of fabric from the textile hub & see more of her spectacular creations come to life!",
        "time": 1768564728,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "chris brown",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100217027363032735174/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIlApmT8Vp9gJRHKweH40snWtch20NmDhi5r8vPNRtgQZ4EQg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Her work is always amazing. Fixed a zipper on winter jacket and put patches on my son's karate uniform. Very fairly priced and clothes where ready for when she said they would be. VERY happy with service. I recommend her business 100%.",
        "time": 1765570511,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Theo Sunghoon HONG",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104488499316147639594/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUw8i6O9hbtNH9y5oKw1LUU8t_V4IK8P_cXqVCJTY6XfJIoDmFMFg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I’m very satisfied with the service! She saved my jacket with a new zipper and fixed my bags, too — for an affordable price! I’m so glad I found such a great alteration place. I will definitely be coming back!",
        "time": 1767028033,
        "translated": false
      }
